{"3011890": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Clown Around", "steam_appid": 3011890, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "dlc": [5062390], "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3011890/extras/813f17d4323a55bb269bad3238c50e97.poster.avif?t=1787594638\" width=616 height=75 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3011890/extras/813f17d4323a55bb269bad3238c50e97.webm?t=1787594638\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3011890/extras/4a33e66fe63391876c7e1ef879a2de78.poster.avif?t=1787594638\" width=600 height=220 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3011890/extras/4a33e66fe63391876c7e1ef879a2de78.webm?t=1787594638\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3011890/extras/4a33e66fe63391876c7e1ef879a2de78.mp4?t=1787594638\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Prank targets while evading the dastardly Fun Police, then try to escape without getting caught! Plan your approach to each level: will you unleash complete mayhem or sneak through undetected? The choice is yours! Explore intriguing locales, meet wacky characters, and utilize your arsenal of clown props to bring joy back to the world!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3011890/extras/97f86d1d6c8a9d07dc94d92f0c24e31d.poster.avif?t=1787594638\" width=616 height=274 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3011890/extras/97f86d1d6c8a9d07dc94d92f0c24e31d.webm?t=1787594638\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3011890/extras/97f86d1d6c8a9d07dc94d92f0c24e31d.mp4?t=1787594638\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Clown Around features an awesome selection<strong> </strong>of <strong>unique and wacky</strong> tools for you to unlock and add to your arsenal. Choose the loadout that fits your playstyle and complete missions in your own way. There are tons goofy interactions waiting to be discovered!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3011890/extras/a203895800011475c98e296b883cdecb.poster.avif?t=1787594638\" width=616 height=75 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3011890/extras/a203895800011475c98e296b883cdecb.webm?t=1787594638\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3011890/extras/8e28870529ea177bc6be17cfcacaba14.poster.avif?t=1787594638\" width=600 height=220 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3011890/extras/8e28870529ea177bc6be17cfcacaba14.webm?t=1787594638\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3011890/extras/8e28870529ea177bc6be17cfcacaba14.mp4?t=1787594638\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There's no wrong way to play the game, <strong>complete missions any way you want</strong>. Plan your approach and discover alternate routes, then try missions again using a completely different strategy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3011890/extras/75b6889529f9c6a87db4a1988149bca3.poster.avif?t=1787594638\" width=616 height=75 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3011890/extras/75b6889529f9c6a87db4a1988149bca3.webm?t=1787594638\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Equip perk badges that give your Clown unique abilities to help you complete missions in fun and unexpected ways. From a badge that gives you a double jump, to one that lets you ride around on roller blades, there's plenty of fun options for you to choose from!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3011890/extras/25cc5277c9919a88a2f02a8b861363ca.poster.avif?t=1787594638\" width=616 height=75 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3011890/extras/25cc5277c9919a88a2f02a8b861363ca.webm?t=1787594638\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3011890/extras/1a47b64eaa3b51f2fcfb40a854a9f715.poster.avif?t=1787594638\" width=600 height=220 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3011890/extras/1a47b64eaa3b51f2fcfb40a854a9f715.webm?t=1787594638\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3011890/extras/1a47b64eaa3b51f2fcfb40a854a9f715.mp4?t=1787594638\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each level is densely packed with interesting things to see and <strong>hidden secrets to find</strong>. You might uncover a hidden piece of equipment, or maybe discover a secret way to play a prank. Keep your eyes (and bananas) peeled!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3011890/extras/3208fb107bf8c65997af36bc2d54e2ec.poster.avif?t=1787594638\" width=616 height=75 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3011890/extras/3208fb107bf8c65997af36bc2d54e2ec.webm?t=1787594638\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">   <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3011890/extras/51404568e19322e667ed1503282767ad.poster.avif?t=1787594638\" width=608 height=174 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3011890/extras/51404568e19322e667ed1503282767ad.webm?t=1787594638\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3011890/extras/51404568e19322e667ed1503282767ad.mp4?t=1787594638\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_para